{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49332","headline":"河传 三 · 韦庄","name":"河传 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦浦，春女。\n绣衣金缕，雾薄云轻。\n花深柳暗，时节正是清明，雨初晴。\n玉鞭魂断烟霞路，莺莺语，一望巫山雨。\n香尘隐映，遥望翠槛红楼，黛眉愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}